{"id":"expl:packages/core/src/llm-prune.ts@L40","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/core/src/llm-prune.ts","span":{"start":40,"end":45}},"file":"packages/core/src/llm-prune.ts","span":{"start":40,"end":45},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:a085197e9dd1d94202087a3e6fb66f002f599ea60d6a7b41d530fa015e77220d","meta":{"text":"Delete persisted semantic artifacts whose `targetId` is no longer a live soul node. Stale-but-\npresent artifacts (target exists, `nodeHash` differs) are PRESERVED. The whole-repo `system:repo`\ntarget is never pruned. Invalid-JSON files are left in place (do not GC what cannot be identified).\nReturns the number of files deleted. Mirrors {@link pruneDossiers}."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts@L126","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts","span":{"start":126,"end":130}},"file":"packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts","span":{"start":126,"end":130},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:da951e84730e7b782b3a4a319366a991831a4f9a6d445ccb4c730f1e6443633f","meta":{"text":"Stamp `meta.recursive = true` on every callable whose `meta.calls` includes a call that resolves to\nitself. Pure over the soul (reads + mutates node `meta` only). See {@link runResolve} for the\nrationale + the no-self-edge convention this compensates for."}}
