{"id":"expl:packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts@L186","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts","span":{"start":186,"end":190}},"file":"packages/pipeline/src/resolve/index.ts","span":{"start":186,"end":190},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:9338369b04dca632efbe282096e47285186c2323bc4c76925afb3090ba697eac","meta":{"text":"Phase 3d (M11): annotate the guard chain onto existing `executes`/`calls` edges. Runs AFTER\n{@link runResolve} so the cross-file `calls` edges it annotates already exist. Returns aggregate\nstats (merged per pass)."}}
